# Build metadata, regenerated by any install and stale the moment the version
# changes. It was tracked, and its recorded version disagreed with
# pyproject.toml, which is exactly the second-source-of-truth problem the
# version lookup was written to avoid.
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

